 🔔 The dashboard: The S&amp;P 500 closed essentially flat.

 Oil prices rose, with Brent crude up 4% to $107 a barrel. The 10-year Treasury yield rose to 5.2%, while the 30-year hit its highest level since 2004. 🥶 Today's stock spotlight: MGM Resorts (-11%) slid after Barry Diller said he was withdrawing his bid for the company after months of talks.

 
 
